abstract: >-
  A simulation-first research record studying whether sensing can guide correction
  or abstention under a fixed quantum-execution budget. The frozen route ended at
  Gate 3 FAIL; the repository preserves the negative result, post-lock errata,
  reproducibility checks, and explicit limits on generalization.
